  "axioms_note": "Axiom 1 is written in squared form on purpose. The equivalent `fracture_toughness = (2 * youngs_modulus * surface_energy / (314159265 * crack_length))^(1/2)` parses to a coefficient of sqrt(2/314159265), which is irrational; the exact rational solver then cannot derive any rational-coefficient case from it. Squaring removes the root and keeps the relation identical."
